    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A drag and drop puzzle comedy game where you can click on groceries and move them around in the shopping bag. Test your packing skills as you try to put as many groceries in the bag as possible without overflowing and with as few bags as possible.a<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3632730/extras/3ac23d44b17e57443c7a1a6cdd7e0f23.avif?t=1745975969\" width=616 height=400 /></span></p>",
